  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e15-scene-06",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "为淳于总主持公道  (Standing Up for Chun Yuqiao)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "crew": "场务",
    "lin_jie": "林姐",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Learning that Chun Yuqiao kept the crew out of the dispute so he could shoulder the blame alone, the team feels terrible until Bu Xiaogu steps forward. Listen to their Mandarin conversation.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "之前老大不让我们参与，所以内幕情况我们一点都不知道。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "这都怪我们之前跟那个艺人吵架。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "不光是你们，所有人都对他不满。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "我们就不应该跟淳于总反映那些破事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "不然以淳于总的脾气，他肯定会为我们打抱不平的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "老大这次肯定是得罪什么大人物了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "早知道是这样，就算受再大的委屈我们也应该忍了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "既然淳于总是为了咱们出面，咱们就不能这么随便走了，大家说是吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "对，说得没错！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "大家想不想跟我一起去找董事长，为淳于总主持公道、申诉？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你们敢不敢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "敢！咱们现在就走！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "之前老大不让我们参与，所以内幕情况我们一点都不知道。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Earlier the boss kept us out of it, so we knew nothing at all about the inside story.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "这都怪我们之前跟那个艺人吵架。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is all our fault for getting into a fight with that artist.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "不光是你们，所有人都对他不满。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It was not just you guys—everybody was fed up with him.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "我们就不应该跟淳于总反映那些破事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We never should have reported all that nonsense to Chun Yuqiao.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "不然以淳于总的脾气，他肯定会为我们打抱不平的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Otherwise, knowing Chun Yuqiao's temperament, he was bound to stand up against the injustice for us.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "老大这次肯定是得罪什么大人物了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The boss must have offended somebody powerful this time.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "早知道是这样，就算受再大的委屈我们也应该忍了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Had we known this would happen, we would have swallowed our grievances no matter how bad.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "既然淳于总是为了咱们出面，咱们就不能这么随便走了，大家说是吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Since Chun Yuqiao stepped forward for our sake, we cannot just walk away like this, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "对，说得没错！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Right, well said!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "大家想不想跟我一起去找董事长，为淳于总主持公道、申诉？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Does everyone want to come with me to the chairwoman to seek justice and appeal for Chun Yuqiao?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你们敢不敢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you dare or not?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "敢！咱们现在就走！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We dare! Let us go right now!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "之前老大不让我们参与，所以内幕情况我们一点都不知道。",
      "gap": 0.5
